{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/3939872/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LIVE・握手会in名古屋!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん前回の全握休んだから久しぶりの名古屋であり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「狼に口笛を」ひめたん初披露であります(`・ω・')ゝ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋もお台場もひめたんおらんかったけーね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えー来てくださった方、いかがでしたかねー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"振り返ってみましょう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずライブ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ・トークあわせて30分のステージ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は１２人での狼パフォーマンス、ひめたん的にはやっぱり新鮮だったな(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人数が少ない分、一人ひとりがしっかり踊ってしっかり歌わんとステージが成り立たんけーね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして握手会。第３レーンは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅ(齋藤飛鳥chan)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわごさん(川後陽菜chan)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みくもってぃ(安藤美雲chan)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんでした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手きてくれたみんなありがーとう(^O^)/☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日ぶりって方もはじめましてって方も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅふぁんの方も川後ふぁんの方も美雲ふぁんの方もＤＤさーんも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろんひめきゅんさんも。とにかく握手きてくれたみんなありがーとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか初めてのコラボねー新鮮だったのよ(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わってから手羽先食べましたー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前に名古屋きたときにも食べたけど、やっぱり美味しかった(*^ω^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりん(永島聖羅chan)の地元、愛知県にお邪魔しまーした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぱぱころさーん(ねねころぱぱさん)差し入れありがとーうございました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"八代亜紀さん、きらっきらオーラ全開で、とっても素敵な方でした(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＹＧＡさん、スマイレージのみなさん、とっても可愛いかったです(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハライチさん、Ｗエンジンさん、応援していただいてありがとうございました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日進行をしていただいたトップリードのお２人"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しいトークショーをありがとうございました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/3939872/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島の人はマジで６月から浴衣着るん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まじで６月から着るし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むしろ６月に着なかったらいつ着るの？ってくらいに６月に着る(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/3939872/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浴衣着て花火大会とか行く？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー花火大会に着てったこともある。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど去年とか塾ばっかで花火大会行ってない(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は東京の花火大会行きたいなー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってメンバーのみんなと話したーよこの前。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/3939872/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん浴衣何着か持ってるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー(ω)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちっちゃい時はままが毎年浴衣作ってくれよって、中元家は浴衣好きなの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからお友達と夏祭り行こってなったら、お友達の分まで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ままが着付けてくれるのよ♪いいっしょー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/3939872/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浴衣の次は、やっぱりあれですよね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それぼかしちゃわからんでしょうよー///にやにや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/3939872/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏にデートするならどんなデートしたい??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お友達と夏休みに遊ぶ約束したんだけど、プラン聞きたい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お友達の地元にお邪魔して、夏祭り行って、夜はオールしてお話、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の日は海いくってゆーね(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵すぎるよーっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/3939872/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父の日。ひめたんはぱぱさんに何をしますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは父の日フライングしたの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一週間前、ぱぱがひめたんのライブ来てくれるから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お洋服プレゼントした(*^^*)ままと一緒に選んだのよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/3939872/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国のぱぱさん世代のひめきゅんさん達に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"元気になれるメッセージをくださいな！よろしくです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぱぱさーん＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"駅にある、画面にタッチする式の自販機も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お父さんありがとうて言っとったよ。がーちでっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも一家の大黒柱としてみんなをリードしてね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで今日の質問"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父の日。ぱぱに何かしましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぱぱさんは何かしてもらいましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}